  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ethical issues in public healthcare institutions with a focus on gender dynamics and exploration of existing gender equality policies in Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is in line with UNESCO commitments on ethics of science and technology. An assessment on clinical ethics a focus on gender dynamics and equality policies will be done, followed by capacity building workshops. A consultant will be contracted. A report from the assessment will be validated. The assessment will be conducted at sampled healthcare institutions in Nyanza Region. The targeted participants will be healthcare workers. A report will be published and disseminated after workshops. The project aim is ensure policy reforms to foster a more ethical and gender sensitive healthcare environment.</narrative>
  </description>
